    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861050/extras/2a313d4bb5c99c86c0e48474b73d6fd5.avif?t=1738240200\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zany heroes, and even Zanier villains!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the wacky origin story of the hero Ice Cream Pachinly and his friends Ponsai Apple Eye, Troy Collins, and The Pumpkin Master! Together, they face off against ridiculous villains such as McChunkin Donut and Dirty Gym Sock Man. Voice-acted cutscenes bring all the characters to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861050/extras/5343c66f9d8727c190c4c083b9e7e463.avif?t=1738240200\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless top-down action\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against endlessly spawning enemies! Use melee attacks to knock them back and rapid projectiles to fend them off from a distance. Gather ice cream to unleash powerful abilities and interact with special items around the map. Play as 4 characters each with different stats and special abilities. Team up with a friend in local split-screen co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861050/extras/a0f911412c5e2664e3d78fe3d8586458.avif?t=1738240200\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><strong>A colorful and cartoony 3D world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Cream Pachinly features simple yet colorful cartoonish 3d graphics. Battle across 8 distinct maps. Earn achievements to unlock hats and give your characters some customization.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861050/extras/2a313d4bb5c99c86c0e48474b73d6fd5.avif?t=1738240200\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zany heroes, and even Zanier villains!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the wacky origin story of the hero Ice Cream Pachinly and his friends Ponsai Apple Eye, Troy Collins, and The Pumpkin Master! Together, they face off against ridiculous villains such as McChunkin Donut and Dirty Gym Sock Man. Voice-acted cutscenes bring all the characters to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861050/extras/5343c66f9d8727c190c4c083b9e7e463.avif?t=1738240200\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless top-down action\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against endlessly spawning enemies! Use melee attacks to knock them back and rapid projectiles to fend them off from a distance. Gather ice cream to unleash powerful abilities and interact with special items around the map. Play as 4 characters each with different stats and special abilities. Team up with a friend in local split-screen co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861050/extras/a0f911412c5e2664e3d78fe3d8586458.avif?t=1738240200\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><strong>A colorful and cartoony 3D world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Cream Pachinly features simple yet colorful cartoonish 3d graphics. Battle across 8 distinct maps. Earn achievements to unlock hats and give your characters some customization.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "When an alien and his evil circus of minions try to take over the world, It's up to a dessert chef to use his ice cream superpowers to stop them. Battle endless foes in top-down combat as you collect and make ice cream to unleash powerful abilities!",
